# Social app layout shell

## Page width and spacing (desktop)

- **Max width:** `max-w-[1280px]` on the main content column and header inner row (`mx-auto w-full`).
- **Top padding (below header):** `pt-6` (24px) on the primary scrollable/main wrapper.
- **Horizontal padding:** `lg:px-[60px]` on desktop; below `sm`, use **`px-5`** (20px) with **`sm:px-6`** so mobile matches the 20px side inset.

Apply the same horizontal padding to the sticky header inner row so header and body align.

## Brand color (Infinity-Primary)

- **`#3D4C6E`** — defined in [`apps/social/src/app/globals.css`](apps/social/src/app/globals.css) as `--infinity-primary` (comment: Infinity-Primary) and mapped in `@theme inline` as **`--color-infinity-primary`**. Tailwind utilities: `bg-infinity-primary`, `text-infinity-primary`, etc.

## Background

- Site canvas: **`#F9FAFF`** — set as `--background` in `apps/social/src/app/globals.css` and exposed to Tailwind as `bg-background` (see `@theme inline` there). Use `bg-background` for body; the sticky header uses a **frosted** treatment (`bg-background/35` + `backdrop-blur-md`) so content shows through more clearly.

## Mobile bottom navigation

- [`apps/social/src/components/MobileBottomNav.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/MobileBottomNav.tsx) — rendered from [`apps/social/src/app/layout.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/layout.tsx); **`lg:hidden`**. **20px** horizontal inset from the screen (`mx-5` on the inner wrapper). Bar: **`rounded-[20px]`**, white, `shadow-[0_4px_19px_rgba(57,57,57,0.05)]`, padding **`pt-[10px] px-[30px] pb-[5px]`**, inner row **`h-16`**, **`justify-between`**, **`gap-[33px]`**, **`dir="ltr"`** (Bookmark → Profile → center → Search → Home). Side tabs are **`Link`**s to **`/profile/bookmarks`**, **`/profile`**, **`/search`**, **`/`** (home); **`usePathname()`** (normalized) drives **active** icon + indicator (**`text-infinity-primary`** / **`bg-infinity-primary`**) for the current route. Tab slots: **`h-8 w-6`**, **`gap-2`**, Lucide icons **24×24**, **`strokeWidth={1.5}`**; inactive strokes **`#A3A3A3`** / profile **`#A49BA0`**; indicator **`h-[3px] w-[17px]`**, inactive **`bg-black/[0.08]`**. Center: **`size-16`** circle **`bg-infinity-primary`**, mark from **[`/Infinity.svg`](apps/social/public/Infinity.svg)** (~**49×49**), also links **`/`** (no tab indicator; home tab shows active on `/`). **`pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)]`** on the fixed wrapper; **`body`** uses **`pb-28 lg:pb-0`** so content clears the bar. Legacy **`/bookmarks`** redirects to **`/profile/bookmarks`**. Placeholder shells: [`profile/bookmarks/page.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/profile/bookmarks/page.tsx), [`profile/page.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/profile/page.tsx), [`search/page.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/search/page.tsx).

## Top header

- [`apps/social/src/components/Header.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/Header.tsx) — **`"use client"`** for scroll-driven visibility. **Chrome (all breakpoints):** frosted sticky bar — **`bg-background/35`**, **`backdrop-blur-md`**, **`z-50`**, **`transform`** + **`transition-all duration-200`**. **Not** storefront `glass-panel` / `GlassSurface` / `--header-offset` (no `data-main-header` in social).
- **`lg` and up:** LTR grid — [`SearchBar`](apps/social/src/components/SearchBar.tsx) (Figma `Frame 92960`), centered **`StorefrontLogo`** **`92×58`**, bookmarks / notifications / profile. Header stays visible (`translate-y-0`).
- **Below `lg` (mobile):** same **`StorefrontLogo`** **smaller** (**`72×45`**); notifications only in **`rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm`** bell control; logo uses **`absolute` centering** + **`pointer-events`** so the bell stays clickable. **Autohide** (aligned with storefront product layout [`apps/frontend/src/app/(product)/layout.tsx`](apps/frontend/src/app/(product)/layout.tsx)): on scroll **down**, header slides up (`-translate-y-full`); on scroll **up** or when **`scrollY < 80`**, it returns. Viewport breakpoint **`1024px`** matches Tailwind **`lg`**.
- Keep [`apps/social/public/images/full-logo.png`](apps/social/public/images/full-logo.png) in sync with the storefront asset. **Inactive** header icons (bookmark, bell, search glyph, profile pill label + user icon): **`#94A3B8`**; icon buttons use **`hover:text-zinc-800`** (desktop also **`hover:bg-zinc-100`**); mobile bell **`hover:text-zinc-700`**.
- **Desktop profile pill:** [`HeaderProfileNav`](apps/social/src/components/HeaderProfileNav.tsx) shows **`{FirstName} عزیز`** from `GET /auth/self` (via [`useCurrentUser`](apps/social/src/hooks/use-current-user.ts)); names ending in **`ا`** get one **`ی`** before **`عزیز`** — see [`persian-profile-greeting.ts`](apps/social/src/utils/persian-profile-greeting.ts). Empty name falls back to **پروفایل**.

## Typography

- Persian UI uses shared **`@repo/fonts`** (Peyda Fanum on `<body>`, variables on `<html>`). See [repo-fonts-package.mdc](repo-fonts-package.mdc).

### Resolving `@repo/fonts`

- Run **`pnpm install`** from the monorepo root so `apps/social/node_modules/@repo/fonts` exists. If the IDE or an old dev server still errors, restart dev. [`apps/social/tsconfig.json`](apps/social/tsconfig.json) also maps `@repo/fonts` → `../../packages/fonts/src/index.ts` as a fallback.

## Direction and language

- Root layout uses `lang="fa"` and `dir="rtl"` for Persian UI copy.

## Icons

- Same packages as storefront: **`lucide-react@0.542.0`** (primary) and **`react-icons@5.5.0`** (Feather / MD / etc. when needed). Declare them in [`apps/social/package.json`](apps/social/package.json) at those versions to stay aligned with `@repo/frontend`.

## Stories rail

- **Layout (Figma Frame 92985 / 92964):** [`StoriesRail.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/StoriesRail.tsx) — column `items-end`, **gap 20px** (`gap-5`), **padding 0**. Heading **داستان ها**: **24px / 700 / line-height 21px**, `#424242`, `font-peyda`. Horizontal scroller **`min-h-[188px]`** only below **`lg`**; at **`lg`+** use **`lg:min-h-0 lg:h-20`** so the row is **80px** tall (do not leave mobile **`min-h-[188px]`** on desktop — it would force ~188px under the title). Inner row matches: **`lg:min-h-0 lg:h-20`**, **`items-stretch`** / **`lg:items-center`**, **gap 16px** (`gap-4`).
- **Below `lg` (mobile cards):** [`StoriesAvatarList.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/stories/StoriesAvatarList.tsx) — each story is a **129×188** preview **`rounded-[10px]`** (no ring / frame) with **`object-cover`** image (`Thumbnail` then `Media`), full-card overlay **`linear-gradient(180.32deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) … rgba(0,0,0,0.4))`** (top/bottom vignette). **Seen:** cover **`grayscale`** + **`opacity-[0.72]`**. Bottom badge **`bottom-[2.13%]`** **`right-[4.65%]`**, **`gap-[3px]`**, copy **اینفینیتی** (**10px** / **500** / white / `font-peyda`), mark via [`InfinityMarkCircle`](apps/social/src/components/InfinityMarkCircle.tsx) **20px** circle **~15px** SVG (same **`/Infinity.svg`** ratio as mobile nav center tab). Badge wrapper **`dir="ltr"`** so label + mark order matches Figma regardless of page RTL.
- **`lg` and up (desktop avatars):** **80×80** outer, **74×74** image: unseen **3px** gradient ring `to-b #3C4D6E → #98BDFF`; seen **`border-2` `#C3C3C3`** (cover not grayed; grayed seen state is **mobile cards only**). No per-story captions in rail (spec); `aria-label` on each control.
- **Parity vs storefront:** Same **npm** viewer **`react-instagram-stories@1.1.1`** (declared in [`apps/social/package.json`](apps/social/package.json)), same **API** (`getActiveStories`, seen endpoints, `@repo/api` URLs). The viewer **must** load the library stylesheet: `@import "react-instagram-stories/styles.css"` in [`apps/social/src/app/globals.css`](apps/social/src/app/globals.css) (resolved from `node_modules`, never copy `node_modules` into the repo). **Not** shared React components with storefront — only the same package + import pattern. If behavior diverges, check env (`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`, tokens), auth, and network.
- Supporting: [`StoriesAvatarList.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/stories/StoriesAvatarList.tsx), [`story.service.ts`](apps/social/src/services/story.service.ts), [`StoriesViewerModal.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/stories/StoriesViewerModal.tsx).

## UI primitives

- **Button:** [`apps/social/src/components/ui/Button.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/ui/Button.tsx) — **`default`** / **`gray`**: **`h-[40px]`**, **`rounded-[20px]`**, **`w-auto`**. **`default`** glass pill; **`gray`** navy glass, white **14px**. **`blue`**: full capsule **`rounded-full`**, **`h-11`**, **`w-max`** (content-sized, **`max-w-full`**), **14px** white label, **`px-5`**, centered row, soft shadow **`0 4px 14px`** navy tint, same blue gradients + hover crossfade; optional **`icon`**. Desktop profile pill ([`HeaderProfileNav`](apps/social/src/components/HeaderProfileNav.tsx)) matches **40px** height and **20px** radius.

## Conventions

- **Component filenames** under [`apps/social/src/components/`](apps/social/src/components/) use **PascalCase** (e.g. `ProfileSidebar.tsx`, `StoriesRail.tsx`) matching the primary export.
- Prefer **Next.js `Link`** for internal routes (`href` starting with `/`); use `<a>` for hash/placeholder anchors until routes exist.
- New routes should keep content inside the same `max-w-[1280px]` + horizontal padding pattern for visual consistency.
